:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[The 9th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''The 9th Angel''' is an [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angel]] enemy that appears in the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = The 9th Angel
|image = E 394.png
|appearance = [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 7,000¢ - 27,650¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has the [[Long Distance]] ability, a very small blindspot, and hits quite hard, not to mention it's often backed by threats that cover its blindspot. Only lower-ranged units like [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] will stand a chance and find an opening.

==Strategy==
Use [[:Category:EVA Angel Killer Cats|EVA Angel Killers]] and try to get [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] into its blindspot.

